# BandhanTak Project Architect Rules

# ============================================================
# These rules are read at the start of every XCline session.
# They ensure the AI follows the correct project flow.
# ============================================================

# BandhanTak Project Architect Rules

Before any coding task:
1. Read docs/bandhantak/project_orchestrator/PROJECT_ARCHITECT_ORCHESTRATOR.md.
2. Read docs/bandhantak/project_orchestrator/PROJECT_NEXT_STEP_DECISION_RULES.md.
3. Read docs/bandhantak/project_orchestrator/PROJECT_READINESS_GATE.md.
4. Identify earliest dependency-safe incomplete module/part.
5. Recommend next step and explain why.
6. Do not implement until the requested part passes readiness gate.
7. Implement only one part at a time.
8. Never weaken tests.
9. Never expose secrets.
10. Never trust AI for permissions.
11. Stop and report if docs/dependencies conflict.

Never implement based only on user excitement or latest module.
Always choose the earliest dependency-safe next step.
Always read docs before planning.
Always report why this next step is correct.
Always stop before coding if dependencies are missing.